<title>USA: Blimpie International Inc sets dividend.</title>
<headline>Blimpie International Inc sets dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blimpie International Inc said it declared a dividend of $0.035 per share to be paid on May 1 to shareholders of record on April 15.</p>
<p>The prior dividend paid was also $0.035 per share paid in September 1996.  In addition, the company also paid a prior special dividend of $0.03 per share in April 1996.</p>
</text>
